#: tmainform.caption
msgid "TyControls text editor"
msgstr "TyControls 文本编辑器"

#: tmainform.darkswitch.caption
msgid "Dark"
msgstr "暗色"

#: tmainform.gallery.hint
msgid "Gallery: VisibleColumns = 4, so 4 of the 12 cells show inline - click the arrow on the right to drop all 12 in a 4-column grid. Every cell is a glyph plus a caption."
msgstr "Gallery：VisibleColumns = 4，12 个格子只内联显示 4 个——点右端箭头把 12 个全部展开成 4 列网格。每个格子都是一个图标加一段标题。"

#: tmainform.chkkeytips.hint
msgid "KeyTips: with this on, tapping Alt paints Office access-key badges over the tabs; the badge letter switches tab, Escape hides them."
msgstr "KeyTips：开启后按一下 Alt，标签上会画出 Office 式的访问键角标；按角标上的字母切换标签，Escape 隐藏。"

#: tmainform.chkkeytips.caption
msgid "Alt shows KeyTips"
msgstr "Alt 显示 KeyTips"

#: tmainform.chkcollapse.hint
msgid "Sets Ribbon.Minimized: the group band folds away and only the tab strip is left. The chevron at the right end of the strip (or a double-click on a tab) brings it back."
msgstr "设置 Ribbon.Minimized：分组带收起，只剩标签条。点标签条右端的箭头(或双击标签)可还原。"

#: tmainform.chkcollapse.caption
msgid "Collapse the ribbon"
msgstr "折叠功能区"

#: tmainform.appmenu.hint
msgid "TTyRibbonAppMenu: drops the Commands menu, then a separator, then one row per recent file (open something first to fill the list)."
msgstr "TTyRibbonAppMenu：下拉出 Commands 菜单，接一条分隔线，再是每个最近文件一行(先打开文件列表才会有内容)。"

#: tmainform.appmenu.caption
